{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/submit/layout,_N_T_/submit/page,_N_T_/submit"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--cveqAo25zrBpxK8bU7Tlk--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/d96866529f32595b.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-928fbb6057b777a4.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-4f212684648fcab9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9cb5ae0e6ce31c2b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/submit/page-a07e71e2615a8b47.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/503-492aa451ee07fc11.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-dce0663d71f3646b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"https://outgoing-tortoise-36.clerk.accounts.dev/npm/@clerk/clerk-js@5/dist/clerk.browser.js\" data-clerk-js-script=\"true\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-clerk-publishable-key=\"pk_test_b3V0Z29pbmctdG9ydG9pc2UtMzYuY2xlcmsuYWNjb3VudHMuZGV2JA\"></script><title>Submit a Build | ComponentWatch</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Share your small-form-factor PC build with the community. Add benchmarks and thermal data to contribute to the library.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Submit a Build | ComponentWatch\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Share your small-form-factor PC build with the community. Add benchmarks and thermal data to contribute to the library.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ComponentWatch\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Submit a Build | ComponentWatch\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Share your small-form-factor PC build with the community. Add benchmarks and thermal data to contribute to the library.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen text-ink flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-line/60 bg-[#08080f]/80 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 max-w-content items-center justify-between px-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold tracking-tight\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm tracking-tight group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity hidden sm:block\">ComponentWatch</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-0.5\"><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/compare\">Prices</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\"><a class=\"rounded-lg bg-accent px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit build</a><a class=\"rounded-lg border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:border-line/80 transition-colors\" href=\"/sign-in\">Sign in</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-12\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-3\">Submit your build</h1><p class=\"text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Every build in the library was contributed by someone who actually built it. If you have benchmarks and thermal data, your build becomes a permanent reference for future builders looking at the same case or components.</p></div><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">What makes a good submission</h2><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-muted\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>Case name and volume (if known)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>Full component list: CPU, GPU, cooler, RAM, PSU, storage</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>Thermal readings: idle, gaming/work, and stress test temps for CPU and GPU</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>At least one benchmark: Cinebench R23 or R24 (CPU), Unigine Heaven or Furmark (GPU)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>Ambient temperature when testing</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sff-green mt-0.5\">✓</span>Any build notes or tips for others using the same case</li></ul></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Recommended benchmark tools</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt p-3\"><p class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Cinebench R23</p><p class=\"text-ink-muted text-xs mt-0.5\">CPU multi/single core</p><p class=\"text-sff-green text-xs mt-1 font-medium\">Free</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt p-3\"><p class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Cinebench R24</p><p class=\"text-ink-muted text-xs mt-0.5\">CPU + GPU score</p><p class=\"text-sff-green text-xs mt-1 font-medium\">Free</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt p-3\"><p class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Unigine Heaven</p><p class=\"text-ink-muted text-xs mt-0.5\">GPU at multiple resolutions</p><p class=\"text-sff-green text-xs mt-1 font-medium\">Free</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt p-3\"><p class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Furmark</p><p class=\"text-ink-muted text-xs mt-0.5\">GPU stress / power draw</p><p class=\"text-sff-green text-xs mt-1 font-medium\">Free</p></div></div></section><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-line bg-surface p-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Submission form coming soon</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-sm mx-auto mb-6\">In the meantime, email your build notes to<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:ike@componentwatch.com\" class=\"text-accent hover:underline\">ike@componentwatch.com</a> <!-- -->and we&#x27;ll add it to the library manually.</p><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors\" href=\"/builds\">Browse existing builds</a></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-10\"><div class=\"max-w-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm\">ComponentWatch</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real-time PC component price tracking and community-verified 